                    sock.type != socket.SOCK_Úl␀␀Ûl␀␀Ùl␀␀ıl␀␀ˆl␀␀˜l␀␀¯l␀␀˘l␀␀˙l␀␀˚l␀␀¸l␀␀˝l␀␀˛l␀␀ˇl␀␀␀m␀␀m␀␀m␀␀m␀␀m␀␀m␀␀m␀␀m␀␀m␀␀	m␀␀
